{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1364103-combat-system-question","id":1364103,"title":"Combat System question?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-29T23:16:56-08:00","id":1364103,"title":"Combat System question?","content":"Hello all, <br /> I just wanted to make sure I am reading the combat system correctly for an attack. <br /> <br /> Bob shoots at Dave, he rolls Dexterity + Aim getting 5 successes on his roll due to his pistol having 1 enhancement. <br /> -Dave rolls his Resilient trait (Stamina? weird for dodging to me but this seems correct?) of 4 and gets 2 successes. <br /> <br /> This means that Dave now has a defense of 3. <br /> -He is wearing soft armor of 2?<br /> <br /> So Bob needs 5 successes to do 1 damage or he can spend those 2 extra successes past Bob's defense to &quot;Pin down&quot; Dave?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1635-citadel97501","name":"Citadel97501","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"544"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T00:29:14-08:00","id":1364110,"title":"","content":"Dave defense is 1, but he can spend the defense roll successes on the dodge stunt (among other options that can be better in some cases), it\u2019s not soft armor, it\u2019s dodge. So let\u2019s imagine he is wearing soft armor too.<br /> <br /> Bob have 6 successes to spend, 5 from the roll and 1 from the enhancement.<br /> <br /> To cause 1 injury you must buy the Cause Injury stunt, that cost the soft armor value (in this case 2). As Daves defense is 3, Bob spend 3 success to hit, 2 success to cause injury and have 1 extra success to do anything else.<br /> <br /> To pin down, Bob would need 2 successes, so no successes enough, but Bob could not cause injury, and instead pin Dave Down.<br /> <br /> If Dave is not wearing Armor, Bob can cause 1 injury without spending successes (still need to hit him, spending successes equal to the defense), so he could cause injury and pin down.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-30T00:31:50-08:00","id":1364111,"title":"","content":"If Bob has 5 successes and a Dave\u2019s defense (after rolling) is 3, Bob has 2 successes to spend how he likes. Applying both of them to the Pin Down stunt is valid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}